    {
      "excerpt": "2.有生育能力女性参与者的避孕规定与方法",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1323"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32190,
      "source_ref": "body.p1323",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1323"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-30096ccdcfdf10789b8955cd",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "在筛选时血妊娠试验阴性后，必须开始采取适当的避孕措施。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1324"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32200,
      "source_ref": "body.p1324",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1324"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-12b24f84f1d0173189edec48",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "从签署知情同意书之日开始至研究药物末次给药后3个月为止，期间参与者必须同意持续和正确地使用一种高效或可接受的避孕方法进行避孕（禁止使用激素类避孕）。研究者或指定人员应与参与者讨论，确认参与者已从允许的避孕方法中选择了最适合其避孕的方法（下述），并确认参与者已知晓研究期间需持续并正确地使用该方法。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1325"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32210,
      "source_ref": "body.p1325",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1325"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-0fc7e4b9ffc537f57a06734f",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "在研究流程中计划的访视点，研究者或指定人员将告知参与者需要持续使用高效或可接受的避孕方法，并在参与者病历中记录与之的对话和参与者的同意（参与者需要确认她同意将持续并正确使用至少1种选定的避孕方法）。此外，还应告知参与者，如果她已停用所选的避孕方法，或，已知或怀疑怀孕，需立即打电话给研究者或指定人员。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1326"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32220,
      "source_ref": "body.p1326",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1326"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-7c5a7c2202481e22139d530c",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "高效的避孕方法是指持续和正确地使用时，年失败率低于1%的避孕方法。包括：",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1327"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32230,
      "source_ref": "body.p1327",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1327"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-39d01d2bcb498f26d354352e",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "正确放置含铜的宫内节育器（Intrauterine-device，IUD）",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1328"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32240,
      "source_ref": "body.p1328",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1328"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-0ea69d52c932304fefa35125",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "男性伴侣绝育",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1329"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32250,
      "source_ref": "body.p1329",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1329"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-6a42ae623296276f77cc1f61",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "双侧输卵管结扎/双侧输卵管切除术/双侧输卵管闭塞术",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1330"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32260,
      "source_ref": "body.p1330",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1330"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-450f8320acce2144827296d2",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "禁欲。禁欲定义为完全和持续地避免所有的异性性交。禁欲的可靠性需要根据研究的持续时间以及参与者的首选和平常的生活方式进行评估",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1331"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32270,
      "source_ref": "body.p1331",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1331"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-d8a1920d625cabeaa715bbb1",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "可接受的避孕方法：含杀精剂的男用避孕套或女用避孕套。男用避孕套和女用避孕套不能同时使用（存在因摩擦失效的风险）。采用可接受的避孕方法时，建议参与者在末次给药结束后每隔一个月经周期进行妊娠检查。对于月经延迟者，强烈建议进行妊娠检查以确认是否怀孕，此建议也适用于月经周期较长或不规律的参与者。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1332"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 32280,
      "source_ref": "body.p1332",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1332"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-5c4374ca5df2617662082913",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "不可接受的避孕方法：评价参与者的避孕首选，以及跟日常生活方式相关的禁欲的可靠性。定期禁欲（如推算日历法、排卵期法、症状体温避孕法或排卵后安全期避孕法）、男性或女性用避孕套（无杀精剂）、杀精海绵等，以及性交中断（或体外射精）都是本研究不可接受的避孕方法。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附录"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1333"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
